猫完全没事。

00:09:01.399 --> 00:09:05.639
Everyone listening, our lion producer, had put a whole bunch of like fernipad things.
每个听的人，我们的狮子制作人，都放了一大堆类似fernipad的东西。

00:09:05.639 --> 00:09:08.559
So he did hit something squishy and soft.
所以他确实击中了一些又软又软的东西。

00:09:08.559 --> 00:09:16.480
I love also though, Rain's unflappable kind of commitment to like saying everyone is absolutely panicking around him.
不过，我也很喜欢 Rain 那种镇定自若的态度，喜欢说他周围的每个人都绝对恐慌。

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:22.299
I heard Adam McKay say this thing, that there's nothing funnier than people being confidently wrong.
我听亚当·麦凯说过这样的话，没有什么比人们自信地犯错更有趣的了。

00:09:22.299 --> 00:09:26.320
And so much of Dwight is confident wrongness.
德怀特的大部分行为都是自信错误。

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:31.480
