我记得是第四季第22集。

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:10.139
It kind of starts off in a little bit of a minor key in terms of Robin and Ted and this morning scene and he's running out, he's gonna go get a bagel, like a very kind of low key New York morning.
就罗宾和泰德而言，它以一点小调开始，今天早上的场景，他跑出去了，他要去买一个百吉饼，就像一个非常低调的纽约早晨。

00:10:10.139 --> 00:10:17.659
And then he goes out the front door and he's about to turn one way, but he stops and he turns another way, he goes another direction.
然后他走出前门，正要转向一个方向，但他停下来，转向另一个方向，走向另一个方向。

00:10:17.659 --> 00:10:31.220
And then the narrator comes in and starts talking about almost the butterfly effect essentially like are seemingly innocuous choices are all kind of adding up together in this magical way to deliver us where we need to be.
然后叙述者进来并开始谈论蝴蝶效应，本质上就像看似无害的选择以这种神奇的方式加在一起，将我们带到我们需要的地方。

00:10:31.220 --> 00:10:38.320
And also right when he leaves, he grabs the yellow umbrella, which at that point we had established as an iconic prop.
当他离开时，他抓住了黄色雨伞，当时我们已将其确立为标志性道具。

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:41.899
Yeah, we told the audience that is involved in how Ted is going to meet the mother.
是的，我们告诉观众泰德将如何见到母亲。

00:10:41.899 --> 00:10:42.740
Right.
正确的。

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:46.779
That's like this magical like little flash forward we saw the yellow umbrella as part of that meeting.
这就像神奇的小闪光一样，我们在会议中看到了黄色雨伞。

00:10:46.779 --> 00:10:47.620
Right.
正确的。

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:50.779
So he's like, he's just going outside to get a bagel, but he grabs this yellow umbrella.
所以他就像，他只是出去买一个百吉饼，但他抓住了这把黄色的雨伞。

00:10:50.779 --> 00:10:54.139
And then it's, oh my God, like, now this is very, very significant.
然后，天哪，这非常非常重要。

00:10:54.139 --> 00:11:01.299
And then it starts to rain and he opens the umbrella and then he gets a tap on his shoulder and he turns and we don't know who he's seeing.
然后开始下雨，他打开雨伞，然后他的肩膀被拍了一下，他转过身来，我们不知道他在见谁。

00:11:01.299 --> 00:11:04.820
But the fake out, of course, is this must be the mother.
但假的当然是这一定是母亲。

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:05.659
Right.
正确的。

00:11:05.659 --> 00:11:07.899
And that's when you cut to main titles and you don't see the face.
当你切到主要标题时，你就看不到面孔了。

00:11:07.899 --> 00:11:10.820
You have to watch the whole episode to see who's behind that umbrella.
你必须看整集才能知道谁是那把伞的幕后黑手。

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:16.259
I loved this cold open and I also love The Voice Over, which is by Bob Seiget.
我喜欢这种冷开场，也喜欢鲍勃·塞吉特的《画外音》。

00:11:16.259 --> 00:11:17.100
Yeah.
是的。

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:25.500
