现在我并不是说你不能采取行动来影响你的生活结果。

00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:44.925
You have to take action.
你必须采取行动。

00:11:44.925 --> 00:11:45.980
And you will.
你会的。

00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:52.370
But never forget that on any day you can step out the front door and your whole life can change forever.
但永远不要忘记，在任何一天，只要你走出前门，你的整个生活就会永远改变。

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:55.720
You see, the universe has a plan, kids.
你看，孩子们，宇宙有一个计划。

00:11:55.720 --> 00:11:58.516
and that plan is always in motion.
并且该计划始终在进行中。

00:11:58.516 --> 00:12:02.710
A butterfly flaps its wings, and it starts to rain.
蝴蝶扇动翅膀，天开始下雨。

00:12:03.909 --> 00:12:06.965
It's a scary thought, but it's also kind of wonderful.
这是一个可怕的想法，但也有点美妙。

00:12:06.965 --> 00:12:18.279
All these little parts of the machine constantly working, making sure that you end up exactly where you're supposed to be, exactly when you're supposed to be there, the right place, at the right time.
机器的所有这些小部件都在不断地工作，确保您在正确的时间、正确的地点准确地到达您应该去的地方。

00:12:19.110 --> 00:12:20.340
Ah, there it is.
啊，就在那里。

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:21.110
Beautiful.
美丽的。

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:27.590
Craig, I think that's some of the most kind of lyrical narrating writing that you and the gang did.
克雷格，我认为这是你和你的伙伴所做的最抒情的叙事作品之一。

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:36.960
And I also, it really strikes me that the entire DNA, like blueprint of the entire series is in that cold open.
而且，令我震惊的是，整个 DNA，就像整个系列的蓝图一样，都处于冷开放状态。

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:42.230
The whole show is spelled out thematically and illustrated in that.
整个节目按主题阐述并加以说明。

00:12:42.230 --> 00:12:47.269
And then as the episode goes on, again, we talk about a lot about how I made your mother.
然后随着情节的继续，我们再次谈论了很多关于我如何创造了你的母亲。

00:12:47.269 --> 00:12:50.870
One, it's a big mystery, it's a nine season mystery.
第一，这是一个很大的谜团，这是一个九季的谜团。

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:56.350
But also a lot of episodes start off with something very strange and disorienting and what is going on.
但也有很多剧集都是以一些非常奇怪和令人迷失方向的事情开始的，以及正在发生的事情。

00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:58.230
And then the episode solves the mystery.
然后这一集就解开了这个谜团。

00:12:58.230 --> 00:13:00.549
So it's like mysteries inside mysteries inside mysteries.
所以这就像神秘中的神秘。

00:13:00.549 --> 00:13:01.389
Yeah.
是的。

00:13:01.389 --> 00:13:07.990
And this is like, this is a great mystery episode, but it's also, it just lays out all the themes so beautifully at the beginning.
这就像，这是一个伟大的神秘剧集，但它也是，它只是在一开始就如此精美地展示了所有主题。

00:13:07.990 --> 00:13:09.830
And Bob, man, I love hearing Bob's.
还有鲍勃，伙计，我喜欢听鲍勃的。

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:11.470
Bob, I know.
鲍勃，我知道。

