Well, I felt a little shy about picking this one because I am the star of it, but I only ever got to star in one cold open, and it is one of my favorites.
好吧，我对选择这一个感到有点害羞，因为我是它的明星，但我只在一场冷场中担任明星，这是我的最爱之一。

